          "short": "Sample answers: $25671$, $19914$, $456$.",
          "worked": "A number is divisible by $3$ when its digit sum is divisible by $3$.\n\nFor $25671$, the digit sum is $2+5+6+7+1=21$.\n\nFor $19914$, the digit sum is $1+9+9+1+4=24$.\n\nFor $456$, the digit sum is $4+5+6=15$.\n\nEach digit sum is divisible by $3$. Other answers are possible.",
